    "detailed_description": "In the distant ancient times. Human beings are living happily, but one day a super life body, Magic Star, suddenly appeared in the universe. He wandered in the universe and was about to devour Mother Earth. The end is coming. Humans are very scared. The Five Immortals are the last hope of mankind. They flew to the planet to investigate and stop him from moving forward! Many strange forms of life were found on this planet. Finally, they understood that this magic star was a weapon used in war and was implanted with a program. His mission was to devour all the major planets. After destroying his own planet, he became a wandering planet. Only the main brain system of Demon Star has been eliminated. To save the earth, fight young!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayer 1 (wsad) is up, down, left and right (jkl) is the attack jump block skill<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbout &quot;Five Immortals&quot; is a gorgeous action fighting game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbout this game, it is a very magical game! The game has created a strange world! There are all kinds of strange life in this world! Inspiration from the brain!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnique and excellent fighting: defeat the opponent under any circumstances, experience the passion of fighting, and give full play to the potential!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAI: The opponent has strong strength and wisdom, and he will try to knock you down.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSecret: There are many secrets and surprises waiting for you to explore!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHope: I hope you like this game, and I hope you can enjoy it!",
